strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_ignored_2026-11-27, 0, "At device scale 4 the device-scale paint path (simple_web_layout_render_html_pixels_engine2d_at_device_scale) ignores percent padding under background-clip:content-box, even on a plain block with no grid: <div style=margin-left:80px;width:20px><div style=padding-left:50%;height:20px;background:#00f;background-clip:content-box></div></div> paints blue at device x 320..399 on CSS row 10, Chrome 159 paints 360..399 (padding-left 10px, content box 90..100 CSS). k=1 is not affected (the 1x raster runs web_styles_with_painted_percent_padding). When fixed, restore the k=4 assertion expect(_runs(3, 4, 10)).to_equal(" 360..399") in AC-4 of test/01_unit/browser_engine/grid_justify_content_followup_chrome159_spec.spl."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_ignored_2026-11-27, P3, fixed, "4x paint ignores percent padding under background-clip:content-box (plain block: Simple 320..399 vs Chrome 360..399)", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/draw_ir_adv.spl, 1160, test/01_unit/browser_engine/grid_justify_content_followup_chrome159_spec.spl, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_ignored_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 webrender-grid-minmax lane, Linux aarch64, seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b (sha256 fb80903917d6d5f5), base origin/release/1.0.0 8da0018549b: plain block reproduces at k=4 (320..399) and the justified-grid case of grid_justify_content_followup_chrome159_spec AC-4 too; Chrome for Testing 159.0.8154.6 --force-device-scale-factor=4 getBoundingClientRect 80..100 with paddingLeft 10px."
    web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_ignored_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-27 W6-2 fixed: Draw IR composition and draw_ir_composition_at_device_scale already carry scaled command.content_rect from web_styles_with_painted_percent_padding, while _engine2d_draw_ir_render_box in src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/draw_ir_adv.spl painted solid and gradient fills over the border box (x, y, w, h) ignoring background-clip. Added _engine2d_draw_ir_clamp_bg_corner (line 1160) and _engine2d_draw_ir_bg_clip_rect (line 1173) to honor background-clip (content-box via scaled command.content_rect or style padding fallback, padding-box via scaled border-*-width), shrink corner radii, skip empty content boxes, avoid the opaque border-box shadow hole skip when clipped, and trigger outer box-shadow knockout (line 1310-1315: bg.clipped or translucent alpha) so outer shadows do not bleed into unpainted padding/border rings even when bg.w <= 0. Verified on Windows interpreter (SIMPLE_TEST_RUNNER_RUST=1 SIMPLE_LIB=src SIMPLE_ASSET_ROOT=C:\\dev\\simple in sparse worktree): grid_justify_content_followup_chrome159_spec.spl 5/5 PASS (with restored k=4 AC-4 360..399 and AC-5 GPU admission), web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_prevention_spec.spl 6/6 PASS (plain block k=1 90..99 and k=4 360..399, border/padding-box/content-box, corner pixel rows y=2 and y=16/y=24 corner shrinking, 100% padding empty content box, linear-gradient content-box, and opaque outer box-shadow knockout over content-box/padding-box/bg.w<=0), and box_shadow_knockout_chrome159_spec.spl 3/3 PASS. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/grid_justify_content_followup_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_prevention_spec.spl"

bug_fix_strategies |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_4x_percent_padding_content_box_clip_ignored_2026-11-27, 0, "Resolve percent padding for paint on the device-scale path the way the 1x raster does (web_styles_with_painted_percent_padding, layout_engine.spl:1120), then restore the k=4 AC-4 assertion."

